From: "google-labs-jules[bot]"
 <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 15:44:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refactor OI Analysis to use OiAnalysisMetrics table

- Created new `OiAnalysisMetrics` permanent database table to store advanced historical Open Interest changes (1d/30d % and absolute quantities).
- Refactored `POST /api/data/analysis/oi/compute` to calculate and upsert metrics correctly.
- Refactored `GET /api/data/analysis/oi` to pull the latest 30 days of data and reconstruct the `history` array for instant UI rendering.
- UI: Enforced single vertical scroll for the entire OI Analysis tab.
- UI: Pinned Quadrant Analysis chart axis to origin and constrained to zoom-only.
- UI: Added Absolute Quantity changes to tables for FUT, Call, and Put options.
- UI: Formatted High Open Interest chart to dual-grid to center strike prices.

Co-authored-by: letssayx <56231955+letssayx@users.noreply.github.com>
